text":"龔貴嬪為良娣貴妃年十"},{"column":"50R07","pdf_page":50,"half":"右","leaf":"6下","column_from_right":7,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c7/NLC892-411999000037-306536_%E9%99%B3%E6%9B%B8_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=50","start":0,"end":21,"text":"歲為之給使後主見而說焉因得幸遂有娠生太子深"}]},"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-007-wuying-consorts","book_id":"b-chenshu-007","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-007-wuying-consorts-1739"},{"id":"c-chenshu-007-zhanglihua:p001","text":"後主張貴妃名麗華，兵家女也。家貧，父兄以織席為事。後主為太子，以選入宮。是時龔貴嬪為良娣，貴妃年十歲，為之給使，後主見而說焉，因得幸，遂有娠，生太子深。後主即位，拜為貴妃。性聰惠，甚被寵遇。後主每引貴妃與賓客遊宴，貴妃薦諸宮女預焉，後宮等咸德之，競言貴妃之善，由是愛傾後宮。又好厭魅之術，假鬼道以惑後主，置淫祀於宮中，聚諸妖巫使之鼓舞，因參訪外事，人閒有一言一事，妃必先知之，以白後主，由是益重妃，內外宗族，多被引用。及隋軍陷臺城，妃與後主俱入于井，隋軍出之，晉王廣命斬貴妃，牓於青溪中橋。","mentions":[{"id":"c-chenshu-007-zhanglihua:p001:m0006","surface":"麗華","start":6,"end":8,"person_id":"3jv_fyp_o96","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-chenshu-007-zhanglihua:p001:m0038","surface":"龔貴嬪","start":38,"end":41,"person_id":"zab_l1p_azm","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-chenshu-007-zhanglihua:p001:m0074","surface":"深","start":74,"end":75,"person_id":"icd_mkz_d9n_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-chenshu-007-zhanglihua:p001:m0230","surface":"晉王廣","start":230,"end":233,"person_id":"ce8_yhf_283_AAAAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2015446,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":58,"last_line":58,"line_start":2,"line_end":247,"raw_start":3475,"raw_end":3720,"raw_character_offsets":[3475,3476,3477,3478,3479,3480,3481,3482,3483,3484,3485,3486,3487,3488,3489,3490,3491,3492,3493,3494,3495,3496,3497,3498,3499,3500,3501,3502,3503,3504,3505,3506,3507,3508,3509,3510,3511,3512,3513,3514,3515,3516,3517,3518,3519,3520,352